    "Sensitivity sets how quiet a sound can be and still show. Amplitude scales the bar height. Smoothing blends neighboring bars. Attack and Release set how fast bars rise and fall, in milliseconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灵敏度决定多轻的声音仍能显示。幅度会缩放条形高度。平滑会混合相邻的条形。起音和释放分别决定条形上升和下降的速度，单位为毫秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
