    "Width and height set the Studio window frame in points (not Retina pixels). Dragging the window edges updates these values. Layout controls the visualization inside the window. Notch Island is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "宽度和高度以点（不是 Retina 像素）为单位设置 Studio 窗口的大小。拖动窗口边缘也会更新这些值。“布局”控制窗口内的可视化区域。Notch Island 不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
