    "At launch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Destination": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visualization": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可视化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These options apply the next time Audune launches. Changing them here does not alter the current session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些选项在下次启动 Audune 时生效。在此修改不会改变当前会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notch Island appears only on supported displays. Menu Bar only turns Island off at launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch Island 仅在受支持的显示器上显示。“仅菜单栏”会在启动时关闭 Island。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Visual preset updates that mode's saved look, like applying it in Settings. Appearance, Window, and Island chrome stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视觉预设会更新该模式已保存的外观，效果与在设置中应用预设相同。外观、窗口和 Island 外观控件保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected preset is no longer available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选预设已不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show at launch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Studio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Studio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These checkboxes can be combined. With none selected, Audune stays in the menu bar only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些复选框可以同时勾选。全部不选时，Audune 只保留菜单栏入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notch Island is disabled. Enable it under Notch Island, or it will not appear at launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch Island 当前已禁用。请在「Notch Island」中启用，否则启动时不会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notch Island appears only on supported displays. Turning off Show Notch Island does not change the Island enable switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch Island 仅在受支持的显示器上显示。关闭「启动时显示 Notch Island」不会更改 Island 的启用开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch Audune at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时启动 Audune"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This registers Audune with macOS Login Items. It is separate from which windows open after launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将 Audune 注册到 macOS「登录项」。它与启动后显示哪些窗口是分开的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audune is waiting for approval in System Settings > General > Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audune 正在等待系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项中的批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS could not find Audune’s login item. Try turning the option on again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 找不到 Audune 的登录项。请尝试重新打开此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login is unavailable in this build. Use a normally installed Audune app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建无法使用登录时启动。请使用正常安装的 Audune。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Login Items…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开登录项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window and visualization options apply the next time Audune launches. Launch at login takes effect for the next macOS login. Changing these here does not alter the current session’s open windows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口与可视化选项将在下次启动 Audune 时生效。登录时启动会在下次登录 macOS 时生效。在此修改不会改变当前会话已打开的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start system audio capture automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时自动开始系统音频捕获"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Capture starts only if Audune already has Screen & System Audio Recording permission. Showing Studio or Notch Island never starts capture by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。仅当 Audune 已获得“屏幕与系统音频录制”权限时才会自动开始捕获。显示 Studio 或 Notch Island 本身不会开始捕获。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
